      "content": "hey i'm prepping for a law school moot court competition and i'm kind of stuck on the central tension of the case. basically, we're arguing about the limits of executive privilege vs congressional oversight. \n\nin the context of modern governance, is the expansion of executive privilege a necessary protection for the presidency or a dangerous erosion of checks and balances? pick the stronger legal position for me to base my opening argument on.",
